1
00:00:00,832 --> 00:00:02,962
(Howard:)We could snap a rubber
band on our wrists

2
00:00:02,967 --> 00:00:04,967
(Howard:)every time we
get sidetracked.

3
00:00:04,969 --> 00:00:08,409
(Sheldon:)Mmm, not bad.
You know, in medieval times,

4
00:00:08,406 --> 00:00:10,576
(Sheldon:)idle chatter was punished
with a device called

5
00:00:10,575 --> 00:00:12,245
(Sheldon:)the scold's bridle.

6
00:00:12,243 --> 00:00:13,843
(Sheldon:)It's an iron cage

7
00:00:13,845 --> 00:00:17,915
(Sheldon:)that's locked around the head
and pierces the tongue.

8
00:00:17,916 --> 00:00:20,986
(Leonard:)If only we had one.

9
00:00:22,187 --> 00:00:24,257
Oh! I'll check Amazon.

10
00:00:27,592 --> 00:00:29,792
(knocking on door)

11
00:00:29,794 --> 00:00:31,924
BERNADETTE:
Housekeeping!

12
00:00:33,932 --> 00:00:35,602
AMY:
We had a complaint

13
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:38,900
(Amy:)about somebody pooping
on a party in there!

14
00:00:41,439 --> 00:00:44,009
It was us the whole time!

15
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,110
(Amy:)Why'd you tell her?
It was working.

16
00:00:47,112 --> 00:00:48,582
(Bernadette:)Was it working?

17
00:00:48,580 --> 00:00:50,980
(Sheldon:)Yeah.

18
00:00:50,982 --> 00:00:53,782
(Bernadette:)Oh, I'm so sorry.

19
00:00:53,785 --> 00:00:56,655
(Penny:)You guys look
like you're having fun.

20
00:00:56,654 --> 00:00:58,184
(Amy:)We're having
the best time.

21
00:00:58,189 --> 00:01:02,589
Guess who won $100
playing craps.

